  - m_Id: 804249738
    m_Localized: 'Legend tells of the Amber Heart, a gem that shone atop the Valley Temple and kept every island alive.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 804249739
    m_Localized: 'One day the Amber Heart vanished. Only clues remained, hidden in mysterious places.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 804249740
    m_Localized: 'A young adventurer fox found the first of them... and set out to follow them all.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 804249741
    m_Localized: 'Jungles, caves and ruins await. The search for the Amber Heart begins!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
